    ObjectAuditing                  = @'
SecurityIdentifier,AccessMask,AuditFlagsValue,AceFlagsValue,InheritedObjectAceType,Description
S-1-1-0,852331,1,2,bf967aba-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2,Descendant User Objects
